# Puppet: Puppet language reference (8.x): reserved words, resource types, variables, strings; requirements/languages/puppet.md
name     puppet pp

keyword  and application attr case class consumes default define elsif else environment function
keyword  if import in inherits node or private produces site type unit unless include require
keyword  contain
type     file package service exec user group cron mount host notify String Integer Boolean Array Hash
builtin  true false undef notice warning fail template epp lookup

line-comment   #
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes interp=dollar
string   ' '  : escapes
sigil    $    : attr
operators  +-*/%=<>!~|&?:.,
calls
